## New Modules (Additive — No Deletions)

### Backend Services
- **auth.py** (532 lines) — User registration, JWT tokens, daily token grants, gift transfers, profile updates
- **builder.py** (581 lines) — LLM-powered generator for websites/games/apps/landing pages, edit mode, project curation
- **asset_pipeline.py** (246 lines) — Procedural asset generation (characters, environments, creatures, arenas)
- **frasberg_cloud.py** (789 lines) — Multiverse simulation with agent psychology, civilizations, phase cycles, mythology
- **frasbergos.py** (378 lines) — FrasbergOS kernel simulation, node graph, scenario injection (threat surge, evolution burst, failover)
- **games_portal.py** (452 lines) — Game registry, scoring leaderboards, voice line caching, multiplayer proxy
- **core.py** (188 lines) — Database setup, plan quotas (free/pro/scale/enterprise), admin utilities
- **db_manager.py** (124 lines) — MongoDB collection browser, document mutation API

### Gateway (OpenAI Compatible)
- **gateway/main.py** (116 lines) — `/v1/chat/completions` and `/v1/images/generations` endpoints
  - Routes to Luchii platform engine or self-hosted image engine (configurable)
  - Bearer token auth, loop guards, timeout handling
- **gateway/render.yaml** — Deployment template for Render

### Assets & Config
- Game asset images (5 PNG files, ~120KB total)
- Recorded audio samples (2 WAV files for enhanced sound)
- Updated test URLs (resolved above)

## Testing Recommendations

1. **Authentication Module**
   - Test user registration with `register()` endpoint
   - Verify JWT token creation and expiration
   - Validate password reset flow
   - Check daily token grants and gift transfers
   - Test with team domain emails (@frasbergai.com, @frasberg.com) for auto-upgrade to scale plan

2. **Builder Module**
   - Generate a website, game, app, landing page
   - Test edit mode on existing project
   - Verify quota enforcement (5/day free, 30/day pro)
   - Check asset injection into game builds
   - Test project publish, remix, and domain attachment

3. **Asset Pipeline**
   - Generate environment, character, creature, arena assets
   - Verify caching (same asset hash returns cached image)
   - Test quota limits for free vs pro users
   - Check asset URL validity and cache headers

4. **Cloud Simulation**
   - Create universe with different physics models
   - Run tick cycles, verify agent evolution
   - Test civilization warfare, cultural exchange
   - Check paradox resolution and collapse recovery

5. **Games Portal**
   - List all games (registry + community)
   - Post and retrieve scores
   - Test leaderboards (all-time, weekly)
   - Verify multiplayer WebSocket proxy
   - Check voice line generation and caching

6. **Gateway**
   - Test `/v1/health` endpoint
   - POST to `/v1/chat/completions` with valid token
   - POST to `/v1/images/generations` (platform and self-hosted paths)
   - Verify timeout handling and error responses

## Deployment Checklist

- [ ] Run full test suite: `npm run test`
- [ ] Build TypeScript: `npm run build`
- [ ] Lint code: `npm run lint`
- [ ] Verify Docker builds for each service
- [ ] Confirm Supabase/MongoDB collections exist
- [ ] Set environment variables:
  - `MONGO_URL` — MongoDB connection
  - `DB_NAME` — Database name (default: `frasberg`)
  - `JWT_SECRET` — JWT signing key
  - `EMERGENT_LLM_KEY` — Luchii LLM API key
  - `RESEND_API_KEY` — Email service (optional)
  - `FRB_IMAGE_ENGINE_URL` — Self-hosted image engine (optional)
  - `ADMIN_EMAIL`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — Seed admin account
- [ ] Create admin account via `auth.seed_admin()`
- [ ] Test auth flow with provided test accounts
- [ ] Deploy and smoke-test each service
- [ ] Tag release (e.g., `v2.0.0-merged`)

## Breaking Changes
**None.** All new services are additive. Existing APIs remain unchanged.

## Performance Notes
- Builder generation is CPU/LLM-bound; expect 30-60s per build
- Cloud simulation can be resource-intensive at scale (50+ universes); add caching for steady-state ticks
- Asset generation first-run downloads model files (~4GB for 3D); subsequent runs are cached
- Game portal can handle 10k+ games; leaderboard queries use indexes on game_id + week

## Known Issues & TODOs

1. **Luchii Chat**: Currently returns "turbulence" error from frasberg.com — needs investigation
2. **Video rendering**: Kaggle GPU worker "not started" — will auto-start on first video request
3. **Image engine**: Frasberg endpoint returns 502 — falls back to local Luchii engine
4. **Test domains**: Multiple preview URLs in test files — use environment overrides per CI stage

